{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876030/extras/0c166e418249a0f537ad47e5ea6d1da3.avif?t=1762018240\" width=616 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MONKEY JUMP</strong> is an 8-player online co-op horror game that mixes chaos, fear, and physics.<br>Every sound matters. Every banana counts. Every scream echoes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use tools, throw objects, and work together or don\u2019t.<br>The creatures react to <strong>sound and light</strong>, hunting anyone careless enough to make noise.<br>Team coordination and panic go hand in hand here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match feeds your <strong>global banana leaderboard</strong>.<br>Earn cosmetics, unlock colors, and join weekly events to prove who\u2019s truly king of the jungle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME MODES:</strong> Classic \u00b7 Timed Run \u00b7 Hardcore \u00b7 Infection<br>No two matches are ever the same new maps, unpredictable AI, and pure madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8-player online co-op with voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound &amp; light-reactive AI creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based movement and tools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weekly events and leaderboard rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmetic customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes: Classic, Timed, Hardcore, Infection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Troll items for pure chaos</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Silence won\u2019t save you. But noise might kill you.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3876030?t=1762018240","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it